---

## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| `oneOf` at root | Ensures exactly one format is matched |
| `format` discriminator field | Makes format explicit and easy to parse |
| `additionalProperties: false` | Prevents mixing fields from different formats |
| `integer` for RGB channels | Enforces whole numbers (0–255) |
| `number` for alpha | Allows decimals between 0 and 1 |
| `number` for H/S/L/V | Allows fractional degrees and percentages |

